==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|alls staðar}}

===Etymology===
A contraction of {{m|is|alls staðar||of all place}}, from {{m|is|alls||of all}} the genitive of {{m|is|allur||all}} and {{m|is|staðar||of a place}} the genitive of {{m|is|staður||a place}}. Compare dialectal {{cog|nn|aillstan}} and {{cog|sv|allestädes}}.

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[everywhere]]

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|everywhere}} {{l|is|út um allt}}, {{l|is|hvarvetna}}, {{l|is|á hverju strái}}

====Antonyms====
